"黄初中迁庐江太守，诏书称其父昔为此州，命靖复任。","evidence":["liusima-q-e745a06497960fbb9330"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-15a078860aab6a1fea1c","text":"转河内太守，迁尚书，赐爵关内侯，出为河南尹。","evidence":["liusima-q2-f6ba281881b29532bb5c"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-1defb0ba506825f14dd9","text":"以母忧去官，后为大司农、卫尉，进封广陆亭侯。","evidence":["liusima-q2-f0ca165414a1baab6b39"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-bd29c8b6640a7e61d4c6","text":"迁镇北将军，假节，都督河北诸军事。","evidence":["liusima-q2-e7cf624b3f46a3ff10b9"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-0178fd5145a797f160fd","text":"嘉平六年薨；子熙嗣。","evidence":["liusima-q2-d751aa4fe8bf6bb73061"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
